Local NaN16 changes live in `nan16-gen.c`, `nan16-link.c`, `nan16-abi.h`,
`nan16-enc.c/.h`, `tcc.h`, `libtcc.c` and `tccelf.c`.  They are described in
`spec/TCC_NAN16.md`; do not edit upstream files without recording the patch.

The tree hash above is the git tree object of `third_party/tinycc` at the
vendoring commit, so the imported upstream snapshot is verifiable without
requiring the upstream commit to exist in this repository.  The current
working tree hash is reported by `git rev-parse HEAD:third_party/tinycc`.
